  "details": "I have a manual boolean in a map which works to prevent access to a room once its locked. This works just fine under the strain of 30 people, and updated properly with late joiners. However, after a few hours it seems the value doesn't properly update (from what i can only assume is network strain over time?) and allows access since the value never updated. I put the update OnDeserialize to check against a local bool to determine if it changes as an indicator to update what's necessary to lock the rooms or unlock them. If there was a flaw in the logic this wouldn't work within the first few hours of use",
